WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.136
Well, well, well.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.096
Look at what
the black cat dragged in.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.973
If it isn't
Sabrina Spellman.

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:16.892
Cheryl Blossom.

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.560
Feels like it's been
centuries, doesn't it?

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.648
Thank you for coming.

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:25.150
My nana and I are forever
in your debt.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.235
Don't be ridic.

00:00:26.318 --> 00:00:28.529
You know I'd do anything
to help a fellow witch.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.202
Nana, Britta,

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:37.579
there's someone
I'd like you to meet.

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:40.040
Hey, ladies.
What's happenin'?

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.542
Sabrina
is a dear old friend,

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.793
and she's come here

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.795
to help us
with our little ceremony.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:46.463
How do you know each other?

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:49.758
Oh, we have a lot
of mutual friends,

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:51.635
share a lot
of the same interests.

00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:54.263
Our covens are in the same
softball league.

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:57.057
Sabrina is the first person
who told me

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.350
about performing
a transference.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.852
Yes, indeed.

00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:01.979
My cousin Ambrose
taught me how to do it.

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:06.275
Essentially, a transference
is a very tricky spell

00:01:06.358 --> 00:01:07.526
that can only be performed

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:10.195
on a night of great
cosmic significance,

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:12.906
like tonight with
Bailey's Comet approaching.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:15.409
Speaking of,
its nearly time.

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:19.538
Brittania, we witches
must spell cast alone.

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:21.164
Do you mind?

00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:22.708
Yeah.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.133
Are you ready?

00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:33.177
Yeah.

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:36.013
OK. Let's begin.

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:45.898
Our flesh and blood
Are but a cage

00:01:45.981 --> 00:01:47.649
That withers
As we wear our age

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:49.860
But hark
There is a way to switch

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.029
Two willing souls
With one bewitched

00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:54.740
Let us sunder body and soul

00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:57.242
Exchanging spirits
New and old

00:01:57.326 --> 00:01:59.828
Our flesh and blood
Are but a cage

00:01:59.912 --> 00:02:01.997
That withers
As we wear our age

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.082
But hark
There is a way to switch

00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:06.460
Two willing souls
With one bewitched

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:08.795
Let us sunder body and soul

00:02:08.879 --> 00:02:11.173
To exchange the spirits
New and old

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:24.811
It… It worked.

00:02:25.479 --> 00:02:26.730
The transference.

00:02:27.481 --> 00:02:29.107
How do you feel, Abigail?

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:31.902
Free,

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.863
at long last.

00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:39.701
Fen's curse is broken.

00:02:42.913 --> 00:02:44.248
Let go, Abigail.

00:02:45.457 --> 00:02:48.418
Let go and finally
be at peace.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.964
Reunite with
your dearest Thomasina.

00:03:06.854 --> 00:03:08.856
Happy sad endings
are the best.

